# Next.js App Router

- App Router only. Never `pages/`, `getServerSideProps`, `getStaticProps`, `next/head`.
- `page.tsx` / `layout.tsx` stay Server Components. Await `params` and `searchParams`.
- `cookies()`, `headers()`, `draftMode()` are async — always `await`.
- `'use client'` only for hooks, events, or browser APIs. Push it to the smallest leaf.
- Fetch in Server Components. Pass serializable props down. Do not fetch in client for SEO content.
- File conventions: `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, `not-found.tsx` per route that needs them.
- Metadata API in `layout.tsx` / `page.tsx` (title template, description, openGraph, twitter, canonical, JSON-LD).
- Always `next/image` with `width`+`height` or `fill` + sized parent. `priority` on LCP. Descriptive `alt`.
- `next/font` for all faces. No runtime Google Fonts `<link>`.
- Dynamic-import heavy client scenes: `next/dynamic` with a real loading placeholder.
- Direct imports. Avoid barrel files that pull GSAP/R3F into the server graph.

```tsx
// BAD
'use client'
export default function Page() { /* fetches + GSAP */ }

// GOOD
export default async function Page() {
  const work = await getWork()
  return <WorkScroll work={work} /> // client leaf
}
```